# AI Exclusion Rules (.aiignore)
# Prevents LLM agents and indexing tools from indexing high-token, non-code artifacts.

# 1. Binary files and archives
doc-examples/*.zip
landing/*.png
landing/*.jpg

# 2. Large static sample payloads and test fixtures
doc-examples/*-data.json
doc-examples/contract-multipage-data.json

# 3. Generated build directories and local temporary caches
dist/
*.tmp
